      "writtenOn": "2023-09-27T09:51:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Frankly, I would prefer to stick with the original API and the Rust openssl API [1]. Moreover, since the Digester is used in various scenarios, such as HKDF, it would be more straightforward to maintain its focus as a wrapper of `EVP_MD` and use it across different scenarios, rather than adding a trait for each case.\n\n[1] https://fengsp.github.io/pencil/openssl/crypto/hmac/fn.hmac.html",
